# Generated code-graph output. Regenerated by a commit hook on every commit, so
# tracking it made 33 files permanently dirty and dumped ~36k lines of generated
# diff into ordinary commits. Nothing reads it from the repo — the only reference
# anywhere is the .gitattributes merge driver for it. Kept on disk, out of git.
graphify-out/
